and it is still not confirmed.

294
00:10:20,567 --> 00:10:23,035
All three arrows point at the same

295
00:10:23,035 --> 00:10:23,929
question,

296
00:10:23,929 --> 00:10:25,763
who runs Nvidia.

297
00:10:26,017 --> 00:10:27,937
As of a little after eight in

298
00:10:27,937 --> 00:10:28,769
the morning,

299
00:10:28,769 --> 00:10:29,601
New York time,

300
00:10:29,601 --> 00:10:30,433
on Thursday,

301
00:10:30,433 --> 00:10:31,478
November twelfth,

302
00:10:31,478 --> 00:10:33,377
before the market opened,

303
00:10:33,377 --> 00:10:35,297
Nvidia's board had not announced a

304
00:10:35,297 --> 00:10:36,537
decision.

305
00:10:36,667 --> 00:10:38,989
There was no new filing with regulators

306
00:10:38,989 --> 00:10:41,277
and no new statement from Huang.

307
00:10:41,297 --> 00:10:42,619
If the board does act,

308
00:10:42,619 --> 00:10:44,859
the company would normally have to

309
00:10:44,859 --> 00:10:47,300
disclose it within four business days,

310
00:10:47,300 --> 00:10:49,092
so that filing is the first thing

311
00:10:49,092 --> 00:10:50,364
to look for.

312
00:10:50,617 --> 00:10:52,743
So why is Nvidia worth so much

313
00:10:52,743 --> 00:10:54,937
less than a week ago?

314
00:10:55,067 --> 00:10:57,357
Not because its chips changed.

315
00:10:57,357 --> 00:10:59,498
Because investors are trying to price a

316
00:10:59,498 --> 00:11:00,547
company that,

317
00:11:00,547 --> 00:11:02,024
by its own admission,

318
00:11:02,024 --> 00:11:04,143
depends heavily on its leaders,

319
00:11:04,143 --> 00:11:06,070
at the exact moment its board is

320
00:11:06,070 --> 00:11:08,853
reported to be debating whether to replace

321
00:11:08,853 --> 00:11:10,737
the most important one.

322
00:11:10,997 --> 00:11:13,002
Nothing in this story has been proven

323
00:11:13,002 --> 00:11:13,583
in court,

324
00:11:13,583 --> 00:11:15,787
and nobody has been charged.

325
00:11:15,787 --> 00:11:18,467
But markets do not wait for verdicts.

326
00:11:18,467 --> 00:11:19,583
They price people,

327
00:11:19,583 --> 00:11:21,777
and they price uncertainty.

328
00:11:21,797 --> 00:11:22,533
And for now,

329
00:11:22,533 --> 00:11:24,797
the biggest uncertainty in artificial

330
00:11:24,797 --> 00:11:26,797
intelligence is not a chip.

331
00:11:26,797 --> 00:11:28,247
It is a chair.

332
00:11:28,483 --> 00:11:30,721
Next time on The Hidden Economics,

333
00:11:30,721 --> 00:11:33,390
we follow the money behind another hidden

334
00:11:33,390 --> 00:11:35,633
link of the world economy.

335
00:11:35,963 --> 00:11:38,076
This is The Hidden Economics.
